# CRUD Users — Python rewrite

FastAPI 0.110 + SQLAlchemy 2.x async + PostgreSQL 16 rewrite of the
[chapagain/crud-php-simple](https://github.com/chapagain/crud-php-simple)
educational PHP CRUD over a 4-column `users` table.

This is the **MWU-CRUD-001 Stage 4 (CodeGen)** output of the
modernisation pipeline. Treat all files as machine-generated against
the contract in `migrations/crud/output/planning/planning-001.md`.

## Run locally (Docker)

```bash
docker compose up --build
# API on http://localhost:8000
# DB  on localhost:5432 (user crud / pw crud / db crud)
```

## API surface

| Method | Path                  | Purpose                  |
|--------|-----------------------|--------------------------|
| GET    | /api/users            | List users (id DESC)     |
| POST   | /api/users            | Create user              |
| GET    | /api/users/{id}       | Read one user            |
| PUT    | /api/users/{id}       | Update user              |
| DELETE | /api/users/{id}       | Delete user (204)        |
| GET    | /api/healthz          | Liveness probe           |
| GET    | /api/docs             | Swagger UI               |

Error envelope: RFC 9457 `application/problem+json` for all 4xx/5xx.

## Run tests

```bash
pip install -e '.[test]'
pytest                  # unit + integration (SQLite in-memory)
pytest -m requires_pg   # Postgres-backed parity (testcontainers)
```

## File layout

```
app/
  core/         config, logging
  db/           async engine, declarative base, alembic migrations
  modules/users/ models, schemas, errors, service, dependencies, router
  main.py       app factory + lifespan + exception handlers
tests/
  unit/         test_schemas, test_service
  integration/  end-to-end router tests
  regression/   security regressions (RF-001..008 — see Comprehension §7)
```

## BR-C coverage

11 consolidated business rules mapped 1:1 to backend tests; see
`planning-001.md §11.3` for the matrix. Self-Review (Stage 5) verifies
every BR-C cell. TestGen (Stage 6) enriches the smoke tests below to
the full Planning §11.2 table.

## Phase 5 handoff items

- `pip install -e '.[test]'` then run pytest against `postgres:16` in
  Docker for parity verification.
- Dual-run harness lives at `migrations/crud/dual-run/` and is wired by
  Stage 7.
- Email case-folding is **not** auto-applied in MVP (Comprehension
  §3 BR-C-11 edge cases). `citext` migration recorded as
  hardening backlog.
